	  SETTINGS_NVS with the required flash support).
	  Enable BT_SETTINGS separately if Bluetooth state persistence is desired.

config AT_CMD_SYSDFU
	bool "Enable serial DFU commands"
	depends on ATM_VENDOR_DFU
	select CRC
	help
	  Initiate a serial firmware update over the AT command UART and commit
	  the staged image and reboot into it. Parameters: <type>, <length>,
	  <crc_en> for the DFU command.

	  The application UART driver must route incoming bytes through
	  at_cmd_sysdfu_feed_byte() while at_cmd_sysdfu_is_active() is true.

config AT_CMD_SYSMKBANKGOOD
	bool "Confirm running MCUboot image to prevent revert"
	depends on BOOTLOADER_MCUBOOT
	help
	  Confirms the currently-running MCUboot image (calling
	  boot_write_img_confirmed_multi for all images pending revert), so
	  MCUboot does not roll back to the previous image on the next reboot.

