config HEAP_MEM_POOL_ADD_SIZE_AT_CMD_GATT_DYN
	int "Heap reserved for dynamic GATT services (bytes)"
	depends on AT_CMD_GATT_DYN_SERVER
	default 4096
	help
	  Each dynamic service consumes approximately:
	    - at_cmd_gatt_dyn_svc_t  ~80 B
	    - at_cmd_gatt_dyn_char_t ~80 B  (per characteristic)
	    - val_buf                 max_size B  (per characteristic)
	    - bt_gatt_attr array      ~32 B * attr_count
	  Default 4096 B supports roughly 4-5 services with small characteristics.
	  Increase if larger or more services are needed.

